Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've read twelve AI headlines, Alex. I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,now have thirteen opinions and absolutely no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent. You're qualified to chair a panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Start here: what changed, who wins, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we argue it through on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The AI Edge. You bring the curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rufus brings the unnecessary commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sense of the AI stories shaping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,your day. Follow The AI Edge wherever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you listen.
